  "sources": [
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "abilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Passive",
          "name": "Encouraging Thoughts",
          "desc": "Hitting enemies with skills enhances herself, increasing her Movement Speed."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 1",
          "name": "Blossoming Fan",
          "desc": "Throws fan in the target direction, which returns to her upon reaching max range, damaging enemies in its path both ways."
        },
        {
          "type": "Skill 2",
          "name": "Honeysweet Breeze",
          "desc": "Deals damage to enemies in the target area and launches them."
        },
        {
          "type": "Ultimate",
          "name": "Meteor Storm",
          "desc": "Summons meteors, dealing damage to nearby enemies in range."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "HOKFIRE",
      "url": "https://www.hokfire.com/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "pros": [
          "High burst damage",
          "Reliable crowd control",
          "Strong poke"
        ],
        "cons": [
          "No mobility",
          "Skill-shot dependent",
          "Very squishy"
        ],
        "gameplay_tips": "## Early Game\nUse Skill 1 Blossoming Fan to clear the minion wave and poke the enemy at the same time. Keep at maximum range of your skills to avoid taking damage. When you have cleared the mid wave, look to roam and use your crowd control with Skill 2 Honeysweet Breeze to impact other lanes and help them get ahead.\n\n## Teamfights\nIn teamfights, be patient with Skill 2. Hide in bushes and look to knockup up high-value targets, but be sure to stand behind your frontline so you don't get caught. Always stay at maximum range of your skills. Don't walk up to get in range to use Xiao Xiao's ultimate Meteor Storm. This Ultimate should only be used if enemies can't escape or help with damage when being jumped on by assassins\n\n## Tips & Tricks\nStandard Combo Skill 2 > Skill 1\nHide in bushes and use Xiao Xiao's combo before enemies see you"
      }
    },
    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Jangan jalan lurus. 2) Pas teamfight pakai assassin buat bunuh Xiao Qiao. 3) Simpen control buat ngunci terus bunuh dia."
    },
